  "description": "Procreate Hair Brush Suite Mini Pack – A bundle of 7 Procreate app hair brushes for portrait art, face & character art, digital art, drawing, illustration, painting, graphic design, sketching. You can experiment with hair styles, realistic hair aesthetics, fashion design, kawaii, anime, manga, graphic design, icons, Instagram, Facebook, Youtube, social media avatars, cartoons, a retro vintage, cute, boho, punk, rock, goth, gothic, glam, elegant, classy, cute hairstyle vibes with these brushes.\nFor painting & drawing hair styles and hair texture in your portrait art, graphic design, illustrations, artwork, or unique hair aesthetic brushes for iPad hand lettering.\nREQUIRES PROCREATE APP + IPAD\n1 .brushset file (with 7 hair brushes inside)",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Procreate Hair Brush Suite Mini Pack – A bundle of 7 Procreate app hair brushes for portrait art, face &amp; character art, digital art, drawing, illustration, painting, graphic design, sketching. You can experiment with hair styles, realistic hair aesthetics, fashion design, kawaii, anime, manga, graphic design, icons, Instagram, Facebook, Youtube, social media avatars, cartoons, a retro vintage, cute, boho, punk, rock, goth, gothic, glam, elegant, classy, cute hairstyle vibes with these brushes.</p>\n<p>For painting &amp; drawing hair styles and hair texture in your portrait art, graphic design, illustrations, artwork, or unique hair aesthetic brushes for iPad hand lettering.</p>\n<p>REQUIRES PROCREATE APP + IPAD</p>\n<p>1 .brushset file (with 7 hair brushes inside)</p>",
